Z||000000||Gokart||06-01-2000||03:35 AM||||It's finally on! I got this from Tom back at Christmas and many thanks to him and DXR DAD for the directions. The only difference I had was that there wasn't the hump that needs to be completly cut out on my 87GT that other Fieros have. So I may not have made the hole quite as large(11"x16")thus not needing brackets to support the frame. Will have pics sometime in June. Now I'm going to complete the FOCOA quarter window scoops and hopefully have those on as well before my vacations over!||||reg||6
